flowchart LR
  HTTP[API routers + middleware]
  COMP[ProductComposition]
  ID[Identity / Session]
  GOV[Workspace + Change Governance]
  LEG[Legacy Execution Service]
  CAN[Canonical Authority Pipeline]
  COORD[Durable Dispatch / Fence]
  RT[Canonical Runtime Router]
  G8[G8 READ Assembly]
  TERM[Canonical READ Terminal]
  EVID[Receipt / Audit / Passport / Status]
  DB[(SQLite)]

  HTTP --> COMP
  COMP --> ID
  COMP --> GOV
  COMP --> LEG
  COMP --> CAN --> COORD --> RT
  RT -. explicit G8 activation .-> G8 --> TERM
  ID --> DB
  GOV --> DB
  LEG --> DB
  CAN --> DB
  COORD --> DB
  TERM --> DB
  EVID --> DB
  HTTP --> EVID